VOICE_STEPS_ANDROID=Kana Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s text-to-speech, which has no Japanese voice yet. To add one:\n\n1. Tap Open settings below: it opens Text-to-speech output.\n2. As the preferred engine, choose Speech Services by Google.\n3. Tap the gear next to it, then Install voice data › Japanese, and download it.\n4. Come back to Kana Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
VOICE_STEPS_IOS=Kana Learn! reads words and readings aloud with this device’s voices, and none of them speaks Japanese yet. To add one, open Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices › Japanese and download a voice. Then come back to Kana Learn!: the speaker buttons appear by themselves.
SPEECH_BETTER_VOICE=For a clearer voice, download a Japanese one in Settings › Accessibility › Spoken Content › Voices.
EXAM_INTRO=Each character once, from memory: a kanji from its meaning and readings, a kana from its romaji.
